erity 5/10, small (a few bags), risks: litter spreading. Kindly arrange removal within 48 hours and upload proof of cleanup on SaafSnap.\n\nThank you.", "confidence": 0.86}, "seenBy": [], "seenExtra": 3, "status": "cleaned", "timeline": [{"type": "reported", "at": 1794988825433, "by": "@@c_priya@@", "text": "Reported by Priya Nair"}, {"type": "ai", "at": 1794988829433, "text": "AI tagged it as solid waste management · severity 5/10"}, {"type": "sent", "at": 1794988831433, "text": "Complaint sent to Ward Conservancy Officer, Ward 131"}, {"type": "cleaned", "at": 1795075225433, "by": "@@c_rahul@@", "text": "Cleaned by Rahul Das · AI verified the proof photo"}], "cleanup": {"by": "@@c_rahul@@", "at": 1795075225433, "photo": "/seed/15-after.jpg", "verification": {"verified": true, "source": "demo", "checks": [{"id": "real", "label": "Real camera photo, not AI-made", "pass": true}, {"id": "place", "label": "Same place as the report", "pass": true}, {"id": "clean", "label": "Area now looks clean", "pass": true}, {"id": "fresh", "label": "Photo taken recently", "pass": true}], "cleanliness": 88}}, "attempts": [], "likes": ["@@c_ananya@@", "@@c_imran@@", "@@c_priya@@"]}]';
  delta bigint := floor(extract(epoch from now()) * 1000)::bigint - 1795248025434;
